// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
mapping *quest = ({
     ([      "quest":                "蛇皮",
        "diff":                 2,
        ]),
     ([      "quest":                "绣花小鞋",
        "diff":                 2,
        ]),
     ([      "quest":                "狗皮",
        "diff":                 2,
        ]),
     ([      "quest":                MAG "粉红绸衫" NOR,
        "diff":                 2,
        ]),
     ([      "quest":                "钢杖",
        "diff":                 2,
        ]),
     ([      "quest":                "道德经「下卷」",
        "diff":                 2,
        ]),
     ([      "quest":                "长袍",
        "diff":                 2,
        ]),
     ([      "quest":                "粗磁大碗",
        "diff":                 2,
        ]),
     ([      "quest":                "水蜜桃",
        "diff":                 2,
        ]),
        
        
});
mapping query_quest()
{
        return quest[random(sizeof(quest))];
}
